      "description": "BullseyeMusicPools has no LLM. It accepts 0.01–100 simulated StudioNet GEN, reads finalized immutable music outcomes, distributes the full pot proportionally, refunds void/empty-winning/unresolved markets, and verifies native credit before recording payment. Failed transfers can retry safely."
